<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Industrial Ontology Foundry"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Certification Ontology (CO)" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Certification Ontology"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/core/Core/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/certification/Certification/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/certification/Certification/> .
